flowchart LR
    I[docker hub or artifact registry] --> B[cloud run fastapi service]
    B --> S[startup lifespan]
    S --> L[load preprocessor and model artifacts once]

    A[client] -->|post /predict + x-api-key| C[api key validation]
    C --> V[request schema validation]
    V --> P[preprocess request payload]
    P --> R[predict + probability]
    R --> A

    B -.handles request path.-> C
    B --> G[cloud logging]
